1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,328
Can you move like me?

2
00:00:02,328 --> 00:00:04,160
Stand up and sing along!

3
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:07,897
Big, big,

4
00:00:07,897 --> 00:00:09,538
stretch up tall!

5
00:00:10,138 --> 00:00:11,459
Small, small,

6
00:00:11,459 --> 00:00:12,862
curl up small!

7
00:00:13,462 --> 00:00:14,404
Up, up,

8
00:00:14,404 --> 00:00:16,006
reach the sky!

9
00:00:16,606 --> 00:00:17,755
Down, down,

10
00:00:17,755 --> 00:00:19,396
touch the ground!

11
00:00:21,896 --> 00:00:22,834
Fast, fast,

12
00:00:22,834 --> 00:00:24,173
wiggle your feet!

13
00:00:24,523 --> 00:00:26,420
Zoom, zoom, zoom!

14
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,060
Silly Pip!

15
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,900
Now, who moves slow?

16
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:32,192
Can you guess?

17
00:00:36,092 --> 00:00:37,403
The tiny snail!

18
00:00:37,403 --> 00:00:38,423
Slow, slow,

19
00:00:38,423 --> 00:00:40,244
like a snail so sweet.

20
00:00:40,844 --> 00:00:42,547
Can you move slowly,

21
00:00:42,547 --> 00:00:43,879
like the snail?

22
00:00:44,229 --> 00:00:46,640
Slow, slow, slow.

23
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:50,405
Woof! Slow is fun too!

24
00:00:53,055 --> 00:00:54,415
Big and small,

25
00:00:54,415 --> 00:00:55,855
short and tall,

26
00:00:56,255 --> 00:00:57,646
we are friends,

27
00:00:57,646 --> 00:00:58,805
one and all!

